.TH MARK-SHOT-OCR 1 "August 2026" "Mark Shot 0.1.49" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mark-shot-ocr \- recognize text in an image for Mark Shot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/libexec/mark-shot/mark-shot-ocr
.RB [ \-\-backend
.IR auto | rapidocr | tesseract ]
.RB [ \-\-format
.BR json ]
.I image
.SH DESCRIPTION
Recognizes text and prints token positions as JSON. The automatic backend
prefers RapidOCR and falls back to Tesseract.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MARK_SHOT_OCR_LANG
Tesseract language expression, such as \fBspa+eng\fR.
.TP
.B MARK_SHOT_OCR_MODEL_DIR
Directory containing RapidOCR models.
.TP
.B MARK_SHOT_OCR_PYTHON
Python interpreter in a user-managed RapidOCR virtual environment.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mark-shot (1),
.BR tesseract (1)
